1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 19=

12
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,339
You're not Song Ziyuan.

13
00:01:16,859 --> 00:01:17,979
You're Chu Li.

14
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:19,900
To keep him alive,

15
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:21,779
you actually swapped souls with him.

16
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,859
How touching.

17
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:26,580
How do you know
about me and Song Ziyuan?

18
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:29,779
But I'm afraid your plan will fail.

19
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:31,740
What are you going to do?

20
00:01:32,219 --> 00:01:33,660
Everyone

21
00:01:34,339 --> 00:01:37,460
must stay in Jinan City.

22
00:01:56,259 --> 00:01:57,540
Who exactly are you?

23
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:59,100
Soon,

24
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:02,059
you'll know who I am.

25
00:02:35,819 --> 00:02:36,860
Where...

26
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,499
Where am I?

27
00:02:39,539 --> 00:02:40,260
Chu Li,

28
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:41,339
you're finally awake.

29
00:02:43,099 --> 00:02:44,099
Chu Li?

30
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:53,140
Did I...

31
00:02:57,460 --> 00:02:58,099
Shiqi,

32
00:02:58,379 --> 00:02:59,059
stop the carriage.

33
00:03:02,499 --> 00:03:03,420
I need to go back.

34
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,260
Miss Chu Li,

35
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:09,140
Master ordered me
to escort you out of the city.

36
00:03:09,379 --> 00:03:10,260
We can't go back.

37
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,619
- You...
- Since Chu Li wants to go back,

38
00:03:13,339 --> 00:03:14,740
then let's go back, Shiqi.

39
00:03:15,499 --> 00:03:16,300
Turn around now!

40
00:03:19,539 --> 00:03:20,460
Looks like

41
00:03:21,339 --> 00:03:23,539
you want to take me down with you today.

42
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:25,980
You've abused shamanic arts.
You deserve to die.

43
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:28,219
But what did you mean about Yaohua?

44
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,420
Why would she die?

45
00:03:30,219 --> 00:03:32,619
To save you, Song Ziyuan and Yaohua

46
00:03:33,659 --> 00:03:35,659
secretly came to deal with me.

47
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,059
The two of them fought tooth and nail

48
00:03:38,059 --> 00:03:40,219
to get you out of Jinan City alive.

49
00:03:40,779 --> 00:03:41,700
And yet

50
00:03:42,339 --> 00:03:44,980
you swapped souls with Song Ziyuan
just to save him.

51
00:03:46,219 --> 00:03:48,379
How deeply moving.

52
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:50,379
You're saying
Song Ziyuan and my mother...

53
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:51,539
That's impossible.

54
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,140
How could that be?

55
00:03:54,939 --> 00:03:56,700
Has my mother been lying to me
all along?

56
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,619
What a pity.

57
00:04:00,779 --> 00:04:01,779
To save a life,

58
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:04,339
you didn't hesitate to summon
the Chu Phoenix Call and reverse time.

59
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:05,580
But in this lifetime,

60
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:06,980
without me,

61
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,700
you'll fail all the same.

62
00:04:09,819 --> 00:04:10,860
What are you saying?

63
00:04:12,099 --> 00:04:13,140
What do you know?

64
00:04:13,379 --> 00:04:14,779
We are both shamanesses.

65
00:04:14,939 --> 00:04:16,299
How could I not know?

66
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:18,460
You think I'm harming people,

67
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:19,380
but Chu Li,

68
00:04:19,979 --> 00:04:21,460
I've been helping you all along.

69
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:24,820
Who exactly are you?

70
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:26,179
What else do you know?

71
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:29,020
That fool Song Ziyuan

72
00:04:29,339 --> 00:04:32,179
wants to save Jinan City all by himself.

73
00:04:32,659 --> 00:04:34,779
But what can an ordinary man
like him do?

74
00:04:35,339 --> 00:04:36,739
He'll fail again and again,

75
00:04:36,739 --> 00:04:38,339
draining your life force.

76
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,620
Only I

77
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:42,060
can help you.

78
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:43,339
Lanruo,

79
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:45,539
who exactly are you?

80
00:04:46,179 --> 00:04:47,580
What do you mean
by failure after failure?

81
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:48,659
Explain yourself!

82
00:05:04,979 --> 00:05:06,020
Sister,

83
00:05:06,339 --> 00:05:08,179
you'll regret this.

84
00:05:27,539 --> 00:05:28,219
You...

85
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:29,580
What's wrong?

86
00:05:34,299 --> 00:05:35,020
I'm fine.

87
00:05:45,940 --> 00:05:47,859
What did she mean
by failure after failure?

88
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:50,979
Why did she call me "sister"?

89
00:05:55,659 --> 00:05:57,060
(Oh no, the barrier is broken.)

90
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,580
(Someone will be here any moment.)

91
00:06:30,103 --> 00:06:34,916
(3 Days Before the City Falls)

92
00:06:37,979 --> 00:06:39,979
Master, what happened to you?

93
00:06:40,339 --> 00:06:42,140
I found you lying outside this morning,

94
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:43,339
covered in wounds.

95
00:06:43,539 --> 00:06:44,539
You scared me half to death!

96
00:06:44,859 --> 00:06:47,140
Mrs. Zhao, who was staying with us
these past days,

97
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,179
came to see me unexpectedly today.

98
00:06:48,299 --> 00:06:48,859
She said

99
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:51,020
the young man in white
she saw in the woods that day

100
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,299
seemed to be Fusheng.

101
00:06:58,580 --> 00:06:59,299
What?

102
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:03,380
(No wonder Xia Ying was under a gu curse
at the residence.)

103
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,779
(It's because she saw Fusheng.)

104
00:07:06,539 --> 00:07:08,219
(So Fusheng wanted to silence her.)

105
00:07:09,779 --> 00:07:10,580
By the way, Master,

106
00:07:10,779 --> 00:07:13,299
I haven't seen Miss Chu Li or Fusheng
since yesterday.

107
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:14,859
When are they coming back?

108
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,060
(Sister,)

109
00:07:19,779 --> 00:07:20,900
(you'll regret this.)

110
00:07:23,219 --> 00:07:24,179
Hurry! Ride out and go after them!

111
00:07:24,539 --> 00:07:25,580
Chase them? Who?

112
00:07:25,859 --> 00:07:26,820
Prepare a fast horse for me.

113
00:07:27,219 --> 00:07:27,820
Right away.

114
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:33,779
Miss Chu Li,

115
00:07:34,419 --> 00:07:36,179
we'll arrive in another hour.

116
00:07:41,179 --> 00:07:42,099
Why are you

117
00:07:42,419 --> 00:07:43,500
so quiet today?

118
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:46,099
Maybe I'm just tired.

119
00:07:48,779 --> 00:07:50,060
I said I wanted to return to Jinan City.

120
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:51,900
Why didn't you stop me or ask why?

121
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:53,580
Wherever you go,

122
00:07:53,940 --> 00:07:54,779
I go.

123
00:07:55,339 --> 00:07:56,380
Why would I need to ask?

124
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:12,620
Master, your wounds haven't healed.

125
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,900
Going out like this may worsen them.

126
00:08:14,099 --> 00:08:15,460
It's fine. Go open the gate.

127
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:16,219
Understood.

128
00:08:24,460 --> 00:08:25,179
Master!

129
00:08:29,299 --> 00:08:30,060
Yun Hua?

130
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,859
Why are you here?

131
00:08:34,659 --> 00:08:36,179
Go find Chu Li.

132
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:38,740
Save the Grand Shaman.

133
00:08:39,340 --> 00:08:40,340
What happened to the Grand Shaman?

134
00:08:41,939 --> 00:08:43,179
The Grand Shaman...

135
00:08:48,699 --> 00:08:50,340
(Grand Shaman? Grand Shaman!)

136
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,260
(Wake up!)

137
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:52,980
(Your inner demon will swallow everyone)

138
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:54,579
(around you into your memories!)

139
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:56,539
(Wake up, Grand Shaman!)

140
00:09:14,260 --> 00:09:15,620
Go find Chu Li.

141
00:09:16,539 --> 00:09:18,059
She's the Grand Shaman's daughter.

142
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:20,299
Perhaps only she

143
00:09:21,380 --> 00:09:23,620
can free the Grand Shaman
from her inner demon.

144
00:09:25,779 --> 00:09:27,380
(Should I go stop Song Ziyuan)

145
00:09:27,980 --> 00:09:29,179
(or save Mother?)

146
00:09:33,659 --> 00:09:34,539
Settle her in.

147
00:09:35,419 --> 00:09:36,059
Then send men

148
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:37,059
north out of the city

149
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:38,459
to catch up with Fusheng and Chu Li.

150
00:09:38,659 --> 00:09:39,860
Secretly warn Chu Li

151
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:40,819
to beware of Fusheng.

152
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:41,419
Understood.

153
00:10:05,299 --> 00:10:06,179
Miss Chu Li.

154
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:07,860
Why have you come back?

155
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:09,579
Master was just about to go find you.

156
00:10:10,779 --> 00:10:11,740
Find us?

157
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:13,220
Where is he?

158
00:10:13,659 --> 00:10:14,900
Miss Yun Hua just came looking for you.

159
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:16,620
Something seems to have happened
to the Grand Shaman.

160
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:18,340
Master went to see the Grand Shaman.

161
00:10:20,299 --> 00:10:21,380
Miss Chu Li, wait!

162
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:22,860
Master said to tell you...

163
00:10:23,699 --> 00:10:24,699
to beware...

164
00:10:26,779 --> 00:10:27,860
Beware...

165
00:10:31,779 --> 00:10:32,620
I'll go alone.

166
00:10:40,699 --> 00:10:41,419
Mother!

167
00:10:44,659 --> 00:10:45,500
How can this be?

168
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:46,380
Mother!

169
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:49,939
Why are you here?

170
00:10:50,299 --> 00:10:51,020
Li,

171
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:52,179
you lied to me.

172
00:11:07,939 --> 00:11:08,579
Sir,

173
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:09,740
wake up.

174
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:11,539
Wake up, sir.

175
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:13,500
Miss?

176
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:14,579
Miss, wake up.

177
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,059
Who are you?

178
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:22,299
Thank goodness you're awake, miss.

179
00:11:25,059 --> 00:11:25,860
Song Ziyuan!

180
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:27,620
Song Ziyuan, wake up!

181
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:28,539
You...

182
00:11:29,459 --> 00:11:30,620
What did you do to him?

183
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:31,819
I didn't do anything.

184
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:33,459
I just came back from gathering herbs

185
00:11:33,539 --> 00:11:35,179
and found you both unconscious here.

186
00:11:37,539 --> 00:11:38,299
Song Ziyuan,

187
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:39,380
you're awake!

188
00:11:44,819 --> 00:11:45,939
Don't tell me you've lost your wits.

189
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:49,340
Where are we?

190
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:51,340
Good. You've still got your wits.

191
00:11:52,299 --> 00:11:53,659
I don't know either.

192
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:55,260
We were just...

193
00:11:55,819 --> 00:11:56,500
Just...

194
00:12:01,539 --> 00:12:02,620
We swapped back?

195
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,100
Right.

196
00:12:05,539 --> 00:12:06,699
What's going on?

197
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:09,579
Where are we?

198
00:12:10,419 --> 00:12:11,779
What are you two talking about?

199
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,020
Are you two...

200
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:14,299
lost?

201
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:18,059
Get up.

202
00:12:21,419 --> 00:12:22,260
Excuse me, sir,

203
00:12:22,659 --> 00:12:24,220
what is this place?

204
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:26,299
This is Lingshan Village.

205
00:12:27,699 --> 00:12:28,900
Lingshan Village?

206
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:30,539
I think I've heard of it.

207
00:12:31,539 --> 00:12:32,380
Do you know it?

208
00:12:35,779 --> 00:12:37,059
You two must be from the capital.

209
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:37,699
Our village

210
00:12:37,699 --> 00:12:39,380
is just a small village
on the border of Chu State.

211
00:12:39,579 --> 00:12:41,140
It's only natural
you haven't heard of it.

212
00:12:42,020 --> 00:12:43,380
The border of Chu State?

213
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:45,939
How did we end up here?

214
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:49,579
(Did Mother do something?)

215
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,539
Are you two lost?

216
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,500
Why not come to my home and rest first,

217
00:12:55,740 --> 00:12:56,900
then figure things out from there?

218
00:13:01,579 --> 00:13:02,699
This way. Follow me.

219
00:13:06,643 --> 00:13:09,810
(Lingshan Village)

220
00:13:10,299 --> 00:13:11,380
Come on in.

221
00:13:12,299 --> 00:13:14,140
I don't have much to offer,

222
00:13:14,459 --> 00:13:16,140
but I can't let you go hungry.

223
00:13:16,299 --> 00:13:17,299
Once you've had something to eat,

224
00:13:17,699 --> 00:13:18,699
you can head out and find your way.

225
00:13:22,140 --> 00:13:22,939
Thank you, sir.

226
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:24,380
You're welcome.

227
00:13:24,659 --> 00:13:25,539
You two rest a while.

228
00:13:25,699 --> 00:13:27,140
I'll go heat up some food.

229
00:13:33,539 --> 00:13:34,819
Where are we?

230
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:37,819
Lingshan Village.

231
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:40,659
I feel like I've heard of it,

232
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:42,900
but I can't remember.

233
00:13:44,539 --> 00:13:45,140
By the way,

234
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,539
this scene...

235
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:48,779
Did you see it in your previous life?

236
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:50,220
No.

237
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:54,299
That means

238
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:57,020
we've left Jinan City.

239
00:13:59,059 --> 00:13:59,980
If this is real,

240
00:14:00,459 --> 00:14:01,140
Li,

241
00:14:01,819 --> 00:14:03,500
this time, you'll finally get to live.

242
00:14:04,059 --> 00:14:04,900
This time?

243
00:14:05,419 --> 00:14:07,020
What's all the noise?

244
00:14:08,359 --> 00:14:10,299
You woke me up!

245
00:14:13,659 --> 00:14:14,380
Mother!

246
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:17,220
Mother?

247
00:14:18,419 --> 00:14:19,459
You're calling me Mother?

248
00:14:19,819 --> 00:14:21,299
Why are you calling me that, miss?

249
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:24,579
You don't look much younger than me.

250
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:26,179
Why call me Mother?

251
00:14:27,020 --> 00:14:28,140
What's your name?

252
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,980
I... My name is Yaohua.

253
00:14:30,299 --> 00:14:30,980
What is it?

254
00:14:33,819 --> 00:14:34,539
You're awake.

255
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:35,980
Did they scare you?

256
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:37,419
And they are?

257
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:40,620
This young man and lady got lost.

258
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,299
I brought them home to rest.

259
00:14:44,579 --> 00:14:45,299
Sir,

260
00:14:45,699 --> 00:14:46,620
and you are...

261
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:47,860
My surname is Chu.

262
00:14:48,059 --> 00:14:49,220
Just call me Chu.

263
00:15:00,299 --> 00:15:01,419
What's wrong with her?

264
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:04,179
She's not feeling well.

265
00:15:07,140 --> 00:15:08,380
Not feeling well?

266
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:10,819
Our home isn't much,

267
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,779
but we do have a guest room.

268
00:15:12,939 --> 00:15:14,299
Go rest for a while.

269
00:15:14,659 --> 00:15:16,539
In a bit, I'll have Yan make some food

270
00:15:16,659 --> 00:15:17,539
and bring it over to you.

271
00:15:21,043 --> 00:15:27,793
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

272
00:15:28,203 --> 00:15:34,873
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

273
00:15:35,243 --> 00:15:38,563
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

274
00:15:38,733 --> 00:15:41,933
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

275
00:15:42,263 --> 00:15:48,923
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

276
00:15:49,343 --> 00:15:56,003
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

277
00:15:56,293 --> 00:16:02,653
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

278
00:16:02,823 --> 00:16:06,253
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

279
00:16:06,513 --> 00:16:09,733
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

280
00:16:09,773 --> 00:16:16,653
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

281
00:16:17,003 --> 00:16:20,533
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

282
00:16:20,693 --> 00:16:24,253
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

283
00:16:24,653 --> 00:16:31,093
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

284
